  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The communications advisor develop, executes and manages the initiative&apos;s communications plan to:&#x2022;	highlight and make visible VWI&apos;s programme, its achievements, its partners&apos; achievements, and builds honest and inspiring communication so others want to join VWI;&#x2022;	be VWI&apos;s representative in the communications Movement towards valuing water, supporting its implementation, as well as other relevant campaigns and movements in line with VWI&apos;s mission.RemarkDue to the transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country has been included in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
